And I tried , and I made it .
So you copied -- you exactly copied the design in the book .
WK : Ah , no . I just -- What happened ?
WK : In fact , a design of the windmill that was in the book , it has got four -- ah -- three blades , and mine has got four blades .
The book had three , yours had four .
WK : Yeah .
And you made it out of what ?
WK : I made four blades , just because I want to increase power .
OK .
WK : Yeah .
You tested three , and found that four worked better ?
WK : Yeah . I test .
And what did you make the windmill out of ?
What materials did you use ?
WK : I use a bicycle frame , and a pulley , and plastic pipe , what then pulls -- Do we have a picture of that ? Can we have the next slide ?
WK : Yeah . The windmill .
And so , and that windmill , what -- it worked ?
